# /social/profile/<username> dynamic routing — now handled by the
# functions/social/profile/[[path]].js Pages Function. It defers to
# static for /keys/, /connections/, /bluesky-callback/, and the OAuth
# JSON, and rewrites to /social/profile/index.html for any other path
# (e.g. /social/profile/<username>). _redirects can't express this
# selectively — see the cf-pages-catchall-hijacks-static memory.

# ── 200-rewrites DO NOT WORK ON THIS DEPLOYMENT — do not add more ───────────
#
# Verified against production 2026-08-03: every 301 rule in this file resolves
# correctly, while every `... 200` rewrite fell through to the `/*  /404.html
# 404` catch-all below. The four rules that used to live here —
# /social/u/*, /social/channel/*, /social/g/*, /social/post/* — were all dead.
#
# The user-visible damage: **every group a user created returned 404.** Only
# the nine seeded groups worked, because Astro emits a real static directory
# for each of those via getStaticPaths, so the rewrite was never exercised for
# them and the breakage stayed hidden until somebody actually made a group.
# Non-seeded channel slugs and the whole /social/u/ namespace were dead too.
#
# All four are now Pages Functions, which demonstrably DO work here (that is
# why /social/post/<real id> and /social/profile/<username> resolved while the
# rewrite-backed paths did not):
#
#   functions/social/g/[[path]].js        — user-created group slugs
#   functions/social/channel/[[path]].js  — non-seeded channel slugs
#   functions/social/u/[[path]].js        — the clean profile namespace
#   functions/social/post/[id].js         — already existed, adds OG meta
#   functions/social/profile/[[path]].js  — already existed
#
# Each defers to the static asset first and only serves a shell when there
# isn't one. If you need another dynamic route under /social/, write a Function
# — adding a `200` line here will silently 404.

# Legacy leaderboard URL → /social/space (cooperation-over-competition)
/social/leaderboard     /social/space              301
/social/leaderboard/    /social/space              301

